<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 96-4 AGAINST SOUTH AFRICA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 96-4 AGAINST SOUTH AFRICA.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 96-4 in their second innings at the close of play on the third day of the third and final cricket test match against South Africa at Centurion Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 227 and 96-4, South Africa 384 (Adam Bacher 96, Hansie Cronje 79 not out, Brian McMillan 55, Glenn McGrath 6-86).</p>
